# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE LANGUAGE DATA — never commit a real OneStory project.
# A .onestory file carries member names, emails and stored HgPassword values
# alongside years of unpublished language data. Keeping one locally to test
# against is expected; committing one is not. Do not defeat this with -f.
